<title>USA: Blount stake raised by Trinity group.</title>
<headline>Blount stake raised by Trinity group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Trinity I Fund L.P. said Wednesday it raised its stake in Blount International Inc to 1,205,300 common shares, or 9.2 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions include the purchase of 77,000 common shares between April 18 and May 30 at prices ranging from $38.06 to $40.84 each.</p>
<p>Blount, based in Montgomery, Alabama, is a holding company.</p>
